{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50611","headline":"题灵泉寺 · 徐源","name":"题灵泉寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹园无外事，秘殿夕阴生。\n云起灵峯隐，风来宝铎鸣。\n焚香流玉户，听鸟度金楹。\n静心归正法，方此谢尘缨。\n（见武虚谷《安阳县金石录》。\n）（诗下原题「高平徐源字太初」七字。\n又纪「皇唐八叶大历六年岁次辛亥夏四月旬有五日」十九字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}